1. pherc343-first-letters, Erwin Nieuwlaar (MIT)
   https://github.com/Nieuwlaar/pherc343-first-letters, commit e8370f1

   Covers: scripts/c_letters.py. It transcribes the per-model reading of ink/scripts/ensemble_maps.py
   (u = clip((v - 64) / 128), the valid-pixel mask, stats pooled over the reading-side maps, the p1 and
   p99.5 stretch from the 129-bin histogram, the per-model 8-bit image and the z-score) for one model,
   and imports read_map, pct_hist and to8 from that file at run time. The letter boxes the script reads
   come from the same repository and are not included here.

